WEBVTT

00:00:19.750 --> 00:00:20.420
Shin!

00:00:20.420 --> 00:00:21.540
Kanzato-kun!

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:23.050
I heard Jun is missing.

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:27.450
Yeah... and Narasaki-san fell into apathy.

00:00:34.230 --> 00:00:35.460
Sanada-san...

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:38.860
What happened? Why did Jun-kun?

00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:41.500
We had no other choice.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:46.600
Now we can locate the Marebito hideout.

00:00:47.810 --> 00:00:51.140
Satellite and tailing them from the ground...

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:53.940
One of the two is already ruined, but...

00:00:54.520 --> 00:00:57.450
Did you actually use Jun?

00:00:58.050 --> 00:00:59.720
Why did it have to be him!?

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.520
Couldn't you have used me!?

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:03.290
Why didn't you come to me first?

00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:05.490
He's the one they want.

00:01:07.530 --> 00:01:12.730
We found out most of the
control pills they got were fake.

00:01:13.600 --> 00:01:18.710
What they need right now is something
able to replace the pills in limited supply.

00:01:18.710 --> 00:01:22.670
Someone who can relieve the Complex
Personas rejecting each other.

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.070
And that's Jun-kun?

00:01:31.650 --> 00:01:36.920
His Persona has the power to surpass
any kind of controlled substance.

00:01:37.230 --> 00:01:40.720
To find their location, you intentionally...

00:01:41.600 --> 00:01:44.330
His life won't be in immediate danger.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:52.270
I don't know exactly what they're going
to do after stabilizing their Personas.

00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:59.350
No matter what, there's no doubt they're
trying to meddle with the unconscious world.

00:01:59.350 --> 00:02:06.960
The mysterious cases surrounding Toyama
Bay, the confusion among psyche...

00:02:06.960 --> 00:02:13.800
These are the "Whale's"
retaliations from the Sea of Psyche.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:19.760
We must terminate the distortion
caused by those toying with Personas

00:02:19.830 --> 00:02:22.240
and all other possible distortions.

00:02:22.240 --> 00:02:23.140
In order to do so-

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:24.870
I could care less!

00:02:25.210 --> 00:02:27.010
Why did you?

00:02:27.010 --> 00:02:30.750
If anything happens to Jun... and Yuki...

00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.710
How are you gonna atone for that!?

00:02:46.030 --> 00:02:49.720
It feels like I just got one from your brother, too.

00:02:55.440 --> 00:03:01.240
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:03:01.240 --> 00:03:07.240
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:03:07.880 --> 00:03:10.690
umetsukusu jouhou
Immersing information

00:03:10.690 --> 00:03:15.090
ikigurushii kono joukyou
This suffocating situation

00:03:15.090 --> 00:03:18.390
jibun ga inai
I'm not here

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.900
kono sekai no bousou
The world is going out of control

00:03:22.900 --> 00:03:26.700
tada musekinin ni toubou
Run away irresponsibly

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:29.870
dokoe ikuno
Where am I going?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:32.370
Huriyamanu ameni
The never-ending rain

00:03:32.370 --> 00:03:36.210
zubunure oitekareta kokoro ga
Soak the neglected heart

00:03:36.210 --> 00:03:41.120
kuzure yuku chokuzen no koe wo kike
Listen to the voices before it collapses

00:03:41.120 --> 00:03:47.060
sasayakana kizunade ii
I'm fine with the subtle connection

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:52.860
sotto anata wo dakishimeru kara
I will hold you gently

00:03:52.860 --> 00:04:04.410
kasaneta inochi ga
yukkurito ima kokyuu shite iru
The overlapped souls breathe slowly

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:08.140
sobani iruyo
"I'll be by your side."

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:14.020
Oh ware izukoe
Oh, where am I?

00:04:14.020 --> 00:04:19.780
Oh ware yobukoe
Oh, the voice that's calling me

00:04:36.470 --> 00:04:40.200
...Looks like that boy is aware of his purpose here.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:43.230
Sotaro...

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:47.410
It would be pointless if we all
died before Kujo-san awakens.

00:04:48.120 --> 00:04:50.140
We're not doing anything wrong here.

00:04:51.090 --> 00:04:52.850
He said he can't use it right now.

00:04:53.120 --> 00:04:54.550
He's just scared.

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:58.060
Either way, we have to force it out of him.

00:04:58.830 --> 00:05:00.920
Hurry up. I'm counting on you, Udou.

00:05:01.530 --> 00:05:03.760
...You knew about me, didn't you?

00:05:04.230 --> 00:05:06.030
Why didn't you tell everyone about it?

00:05:06.670 --> 00:05:09.000
Because I knew you were lost.

00:05:15.310 --> 00:05:16.210
Kanaru-san...

00:05:17.050 --> 00:05:18.310
Jun-kun...

00:05:18.980 --> 00:05:20.780
This again...

00:05:21.820 --> 00:05:22.650
Where are we?

00:05:22.950 --> 00:05:24.380
You came here on your own.

00:05:25.850 --> 00:05:28.410
You disguised yourself as
Mayuri-chan and brought us here...

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:30.220
That girl...

00:05:30.390 --> 00:05:32.920
Mayuri-chan doesn't exist.

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:34.690
Neither do you.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:43.600
Matsui and Murata are no call, no show.

00:05:44.710 --> 00:05:45.600
...Morimoto?

00:05:46.940 --> 00:05:47.640
Yano...

00:05:48.710 --> 00:05:49.370
Yano?

00:05:49.680 --> 00:05:50.840
There you are.

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.850
...No, I'm Kouki.

00:05:54.250 --> 00:05:55.550
Kayama Kouki.

00:05:57.650 --> 00:05:59.640
Hey... Stop joking around.

00:06:00.090 --> 00:06:01.890
But you have it wrong...

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:04.120
It's all wrong!

00:06:09.730 --> 00:06:11.790
What the hell is going on?

00:06:13.370 --> 00:06:14.940
Can't get a hold of Yamasaki either.

00:06:14.940 --> 00:06:18.430
We should get out early and check their houses.

00:06:18.810 --> 00:06:19.470
Yeah.

00:06:20.580 --> 00:06:21.640
Could he be?

00:06:21.640 --> 00:06:23.610
Could Jun be having the same problem?

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:28.950
It... felt like I was talking to a girl yesterday.

00:06:31.590 --> 00:06:34.720
The clothes Kanzato-kun had last night...

00:06:34.720 --> 00:06:38.850
and how he mentioned "Yuki" to Sanada-san...

00:06:39.730 --> 00:06:41.420
I thought Yuki was...

00:06:42.260 --> 00:06:44.750
Yeah... Their sister who passed away.

00:06:47.030 --> 00:06:48.060
Volunteered?

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:52.370
Yeah. Apparently, he visited the
Ayanagi Station alone a while ago...

00:06:52.910 --> 00:06:55.600
He volunteered to be the decoy.

00:06:56.280 --> 00:06:59.870
Sanada-san considered it the last resort,

00:07:00.520 --> 00:07:04.540
but he knew it was gonna be
too dangerous and impractical.

00:07:06.020 --> 00:07:07.680
So that wasn't actually part of-

00:07:07.890 --> 00:07:09.360
Then why!?

00:07:09.720 --> 00:07:12.020
That was the only choice we had, after all.

00:07:12.430 --> 00:07:14.220
Jun-kun had already foreseen it.

00:07:14.660 --> 00:07:18.790
It's a fight against the source of this tragedy, right?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:20.300
Jun...

00:07:21.740 --> 00:07:22.760
Chief Kanzato...

00:07:23.170 --> 00:07:25.040
It's the same for your older brother,

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:30.130
but we all belong to an organization, and
there are things we can't do because of that.

00:07:30.750 --> 00:07:36.510
Covering up the truth was our mission,
but our goal is to terminate the source.

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.080
I'm aware of that.

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.760
The amount of pills they've got,

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:45.160
and the status of their Complex Personas
considering the number of Reverse victims...

00:07:46.030 --> 00:07:49.360
They had no choice but to make
their move these past few days.

00:07:49.860 --> 00:07:52.330
And that meant our last chance.

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:57.670
We had Detective Narasaki trail them
to prevent our previous mistake...

00:07:57.670 --> 00:07:59.970
To repent for what happened to Nikaido-san.

00:08:00.740 --> 00:08:04.610
The temporary chief and
Ito-san are getting prepared.

00:08:05.650 --> 00:08:10.490
With you Persona users, they'll save
Jun-kun, suppress the Marebito,

00:08:10.490 --> 00:08:14.750
destroy the research facility,
and with it, all the research data.

00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:22.300
I apologize... I don't think it's right to drag
all of you in and make you risk your lives...

00:08:22.300 --> 00:08:23.320
Sanada-san, too...

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:28.460
He was a champion boxer as a student.

00:08:34.840 --> 00:08:35.600
Sign: "This Stop - Hiiragi Pharmaceutical"

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:46.050
Yes, I will resign in the next executive meeting.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:49.720
No...

00:08:50.190 --> 00:08:52.460
Nagai's action was all because of our immorality.

00:08:53.030 --> 00:08:53.820
My time is over.

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:56.130
Yes, please.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.020
Get the car.

00:09:02.900 --> 00:09:05.740
Please. I'd really like to see him.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:08.270
He should know if you tell him my name, Kanzato.

00:09:20.620 --> 00:09:21.950
All right, let's begin.

00:09:23.560 --> 00:09:24.250
Come.

00:09:28.360 --> 00:09:30.870
Hold on, what are you doing to Jun-kun?

00:09:30.870 --> 00:09:32.500
Why are you doing all this?

00:09:32.500 --> 00:09:33.730
For what?

00:09:33.730 --> 00:09:36.400
The other you doesn't tell you anything, huh?

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.340
Stop! What are you doing!?

00:09:50.550 --> 00:09:52.640
Saki, can you shut that puppet up?

00:09:54.690 --> 00:09:57.280
You feel guilt towards Yamasaki Mayuri.

00:09:58.260 --> 00:10:02.250
Only you were taken in by a wealthy family,
even though we were from the same orphanage.

00:10:03.830 --> 00:10:08.500
I was a little surprised to see you react
exactly according to your settings.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.370
Settings?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:24.550
Can you read my mind, too?

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.340
You're afraid.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.720
When we met for the first
time and probably now, too.

00:10:31.930 --> 00:10:33.190
What would I be-?

00:10:33.460 --> 00:10:36.360
Of being emptied.

00:10:51.850 --> 00:10:52.680
Stop the car.

00:10:53.510 --> 00:10:54.280
But...

00:10:54.680 --> 00:10:57.080
I want to watch the water for a bit.

00:11:07.500 --> 00:11:09.330
President Hiiragi... right?

00:11:20.440 --> 00:11:24.070
Yes, the area executives made their decision.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:27.340
The temporary chief understands the consequences.

00:11:27.920 --> 00:11:31.410
We've narrowed down the area, and
now we're going to specify the location.

00:11:32.220 --> 00:11:33.280
Roger that.

00:11:34.160 --> 00:11:35.520
Narasaki, let's go.

00:11:41.230 --> 00:11:46.560
I saw the old picture with you
and... my father and mother.

00:11:47.970 --> 00:11:52.060
Will you please tell me...
what my parents were involved in?

00:11:58.310 --> 00:11:59.240
Where's Shiiba?

00:11:59.510 --> 00:12:01.210
Staying with Kujo-san.

00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:04.710
Shiiba really likes him...

00:12:06.050 --> 00:12:11.180
I wonder if he doesn't like me or Wakasa
because we talk crap about Kujo-san?

00:12:12.960 --> 00:12:14.990
It's not about like or dislike.

00:12:16.000 --> 00:12:17.590
He had no choice but to cling on.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:28.640
It was a chance to start over for
those who regretted their mistakes.

00:12:29.280 --> 00:12:34.850
However, the more we pursued the potential
of Personas, the supernatural bodies,

00:12:34.850 --> 00:12:37.150
the more twisted the research became.

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:43.890
The sponsors wished to create an existence
able to control people unconsciously.

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:50.830
Under the theory on weakened ties between
people's consciousness and unconsciousness,

00:12:50.830 --> 00:12:52.660
we devoted ourselves to that research.

00:12:53.330 --> 00:12:54.200
However...

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.100
We ended up unintentionally creating a subspecies.

00:12:57.100 --> 00:12:57.900
A subspecies?

00:12:58.440 --> 00:13:03.500
Artificial creations of forced
unification, going against providence.

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:05.870
The Marebitos'...

00:13:06.510 --> 00:13:07.740
Complex Personas.

00:13:08.280 --> 00:13:12.480
I couldn't possibly bring the experiments
we conducted to the public eye.

00:13:15.960 --> 00:13:17.480
Our devotion caused us to grow blind.

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:21.920
We abandoned logic and
accepted Komatsubara's actions.

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:26.170
When he discovered his own child
would be the perfect subject,

00:13:26.170 --> 00:13:28.160
he ran tests on her without hesitation.

00:13:29.400 --> 00:13:33.900
He gathered support and led the research...

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:36.400
We used that as our excuse

00:13:37.210 --> 00:13:38.610
to continue experimenting.

00:13:39.310 --> 00:13:43.270
She devoted herself to the research, trying to
impress her father, and turned into a witch.

00:13:44.250 --> 00:13:48.590
Her growth stopped as a side effect from all the
chemicals getting injected into her small body.

00:13:49.460 --> 00:13:50.350
Eventually,

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:54.590
she realized her existence represented
nothing but a cruel mistake, and then...

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.400
Your parents left the team

00:14:05.110 --> 00:14:06.000
around that time.

00:14:08.010 --> 00:14:12.670
Komatsubara once mentioned the great potential
he expected in you, the unborn child at the time.

00:14:13.250 --> 00:14:16.610
I believe that was another factor which
helped your parents come to their senses.

00:14:18.650 --> 00:14:21.780
After that, he grew even more obsessed...

00:14:22.490 --> 00:14:26.620
He bought out an orphanage, and
during the disasters of ten years ago,

00:14:27.230 --> 00:14:28.160
the children were...

00:14:31.830 --> 00:14:35.200
I wonder how many were there, including us?

00:14:35.840 --> 00:14:39.360
Who knows? I'm sure
there were more before us, too.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:41.740
It's not working.

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.770
What if it's already been cut off by Kanzato Shin?

00:14:51.750 --> 00:14:53.980
Sotaro, let's get out of here.

00:14:54.960 --> 00:14:56.750
Let's go see Kanzato Shin.

00:14:57.060 --> 00:14:58.620
What are you saying?

00:15:05.770 --> 00:15:08.140
Let's cut it off and start over again.

00:15:08.140 --> 00:15:08.900
Udou...

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:12.830
Saki. If Toma and Yuji were
still here, they would also-

00:15:13.210 --> 00:15:15.110
Move. I'll do it.

00:15:16.910 --> 00:15:19.180
Should everything really be redone?

00:15:21.250 --> 00:15:23.010
We are the chosen ones...

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:25.210
D-dammit!

00:15:27.350 --> 00:15:29.580
We are special...

00:15:31.030 --> 00:15:32.860
What's the point of you watching?

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.350
So I don't forget. Our mission.

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:39.320
We've no choice but to believe
in Kujo-san and keep going.

00:15:44.370 --> 00:15:45.930
What's going to happen to us?

00:15:46.670 --> 00:15:47.880
What do you mean?

00:15:47.880 --> 00:15:52.900
The Personas we gathered this time
are different from what we're used to.

00:15:55.520 --> 00:15:59.210
If we continue to gather
the new latents on the list...

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.910
I'm afraid they'll become too much to handle.

00:16:03.320 --> 00:16:05.920
For now, I demand to see Kanzato Ryo.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:08.690
Bring him to me. I will explain later.

00:16:10.230 --> 00:16:12.220
Extract him, if he refuses.

00:16:12.970 --> 00:16:13.630
Yes, sir.

00:16:13.870 --> 00:16:16.340
You all are still incomplete.

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:21.230
Do not go against a Special A Latent alone.

00:16:22.180 --> 00:16:24.370
One who sees the minds of others...

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:30.010
Report to me if you find one within the A Latents.

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:38.250
I never trusted that man from the start.

00:16:39.190 --> 00:16:41.760
Someone who will always be with me...

00:16:41.760 --> 00:16:44.160
Someone who will never
leave me, never betray me...

00:16:44.160 --> 00:16:46.000
That's all I wanted.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:50.900
Even if that someone's just another me
who's been patched together, out of shape...

00:17:01.080 --> 00:17:02.570
The ones who survived...

00:17:03.120 --> 00:17:05.880
They must have had a stronger
tolerance compared to other children.

00:17:07.220 --> 00:17:08.380
But by now, they're...

00:17:09.190 --> 00:17:12.490
All we wanted was to utilize the power of Personas.

00:17:14.130 --> 00:17:16.430
Despite everyone's despair.

00:17:19.230 --> 00:17:21.130
Your parents felt deep remorse.

00:17:21.440 --> 00:17:24.000
The fact they were involved,
but left in the middle of it all.

00:17:25.010 --> 00:17:27.000
But... they're not here anymore.

00:17:28.040 --> 00:17:30.010
It's not something that can be forgiven.

00:17:31.680 --> 00:17:33.340
Same goes for the Marebito.

00:17:34.380 --> 00:17:36.320
Please, don't run away from this.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:40.850
My younger brother is with them right now.

00:17:43.090 --> 00:17:43.890
I see...

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:49.000
Komatsubara united the fields
of neuroscience and psychology.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:53.760
He invented several ways to create an existence
that harmonizes with Complex Personas.

00:17:53.830 --> 00:17:57.770
He conducted various clinical trials where
the secondary effect was his main focus.

00:17:58.510 --> 00:18:00.840
On that day, too, an opportunity arose.

00:18:01.440 --> 00:18:02.570
Ten years ago...

00:18:03.440 --> 00:18:05.000
So it was him.

00:18:06.810 --> 00:18:08.750
I thought we owed Jun's life to him.

00:18:09.220 --> 00:18:10.510
Jun and Yuki were...

00:18:12.150 --> 00:18:14.090
just being used as an experiment.

00:18:25.070 --> 00:18:25.790
Wh-what the-?

00:18:26.870 --> 00:18:28.600
Shiiba is reaching his limit.

00:18:30.540 --> 00:18:31.940
There's no point, Udou.

00:18:41.150 --> 00:18:44.480
Hey, Saki... Want me to show
you something interesting?

00:18:58.670 --> 00:18:59.460
Shiiba!

00:19:13.910 --> 00:19:14.680
What is this?

00:19:14.880 --> 00:19:19.150
After our second gathering of A Latents,
I retraced Yuji's steps...

00:19:20.090 --> 00:19:21.610
He was dead here.

00:19:39.710 --> 00:19:41.300
You've seen her before.

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:45.680
She's Kujo-san's child.

00:19:50.480 --> 00:19:51.470
I promise you this.

00:19:51.950 --> 00:19:56.620
I'll go public about our unlicensed drug
research and demand a proper trial.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.520
I pray for the safety of your brother.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:04.330
Kanzato-kun.

00:20:04.900 --> 00:20:07.770
Do you remember what happened ten years ago?

00:20:08.500 --> 00:20:10.990
No... We were in a train crash.

00:20:11.370 --> 00:20:13.640
I was told the trauma from that caused me to...

00:20:14.410 --> 00:20:15.140
I see.

00:20:22.520 --> 00:20:23.410
Jun-kun...

00:20:27.250 --> 00:20:28.810
She's still resting.

00:20:29.760 --> 00:20:33.350
The real one was probably
killed during an experiment.

00:20:34.160 --> 00:20:36.720
Why do you think this thing was created?

00:20:38.170 --> 00:20:41.290
Kujo-san's gonna transplant
everything into her eventually.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:45.700
You and I are just flowerpots.

00:20:46.140 --> 00:20:50.800
Yuji, Shiiba, Wakasa, Udou, and Toma, too.

00:20:51.710 --> 00:20:52.580
Can't be...

00:20:53.910 --> 00:21:01.180
He's trying to take everything from us and
use her to control people from their psyche.

00:21:06.990 --> 00:21:07.790
Sotaro.

00:21:09.200 --> 00:21:13.790
We, the Marebito, are sacrifices to his goddess.

00:21:17.900 --> 00:21:19.060
I'm not empty...

00:21:19.610 --> 00:21:21.270
I'm not.

00:21:22.980 --> 00:21:23.840
It's you...

00:21:24.780 --> 00:21:25.640
You're the one.

00:21:31.080 --> 00:21:32.550
Stop looking at me...

00:21:34.490 --> 00:21:37.950
Stop looking at me with your empty eyes!

00:21:52.510 --> 00:21:57.810
Itsukara yume miru koto
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:21:57.810 --> 00:22:03.820
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
When did I start pretending
like I didn't dream of anything?

00:22:03.820 --> 00:22:03.880
Wasureta huri wo shitetan darou
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:10.120
chiisana mado akeru yuuki mo naku
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:15.300
kiseki wo matteta
With no courage to open a small
window, I waited for a miracle

00:22:15.300 --> 00:22:15.330
kiseki wo matteta
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:15.330 --> 00:22:25.440
ushinau mono nado nakatta anohi no yona
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:25.440 --> 00:22:30.840
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
I'm not as innocent as I used to be in
the days when I had nothing to lose

00:22:30.840 --> 00:22:30.880
mujakisa wa mou naikedo
After wiping away the tears

00:22:30.880 --> 00:22:37.050
namida wo nugutta ato niwa
After wiping away the tears

00:22:37.050 --> 00:22:42.990
atarashii jibun ni deaeru
I'll be able to meet a new self

00:22:42.990 --> 00:22:46.930
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
Even if I lose everything

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:53.100
subete wo nakushitemo
mitsuke rareru monoga arukara
There are still some things to discover

00:22:53.100 --> 00:22:58.910
kesenai kizumo itsuka
Even the scars that remain

00:22:58.910 --> 00:22:58.940
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
Even the scars that remain

00:22:58.940 --> 00:23:05.970
watashi rashii hokori ni dekiru
will someday become my pride

00:23:10.920 --> 00:23:14.120
What each of us long for

00:23:14.120 --> 00:23:17.820
is a small happiness...

00:23:17.820 --> 00:23:23.330
something most important, and most cruel.

00:23:23.330 --> 00:23:26.500
Mistakes, overlapping sins.

00:23:26.500 --> 00:23:29.940
A torn newly-born thought.

00:23:29.940 --> 00:23:33.540
A reunion for each parting.

00:23:33.540 --> 00:23:35.780
A small happiness.

00:23:35.780 --> 00:23:39.180
Gathering these results in true peace.
